{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20017411,"chapterID":15000403,"chapterNumber":"IV-3","sectionNumber":"43-44","title":"Alternate Front Setbacks","officialText":"","previewText":"M1 M2 M3\n\nIn all districts, other than districts with an A suffix, if an open area is provided along the full length of the front lot line with the minimum depth set forth in the following table, the provisions of Section 43-43 (Maximum Height of Front Wall and Required Front Setbacks) shall not apply. The minimum depth of such open area shall be measured perpendicular to the front lot line. However, in such instance","blocks":[{"id":"zr-17411-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>M1 M2 M3</span></p>","plainText":"M1 M2 M3"},{"id":"zr-17411-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In all districts, other than districts with an A suffix, if an open area is provided along the full length of the <strong><em>front lot line</em></strong> with the minimum depth set forth in the following table, the provisions of Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-43\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-43\"><span>43-43</span></a> (Maximum Height of Front Wall and Required Front Setbacks) shall not apply. The minimum depth of such open area shall be measured perpendicular to the <strong><em>front lot line</em></strong>. However, in such instances, except as otherwise provided in this Section or in Sections <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-42\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-42\"><span>43-42</span></a> (Permitted Obstructions) or <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-45\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-45\"><span>43-45</span></a> (Tower Regulations), no <strong><em>building or other structure</em></strong> shall penetrate the alternate <strong><em>sky exposure plane</em></strong> set forth in the table in this Section. The <strong><em>sky exposure plane</em></strong> shall be measured from a point above the <strong><em>street line</em></strong>.</span></p>","plainText":"In all districts, other than districts with an A suffix, if an open area is provided along the full length of the front lot line with the minimum depth set forth in the following table, the provisions of Section 43-43 (Maximum Height of Front Wall and Required Front Setbacks) shall not apply. The minimum depth of such open area shall be measured perpendicular to the front lot line. However, in such instances, except as otherwise provided in this Section or in Sections 43-42 (Permitted Obstructions) or 43-45 (Tower Regulations), no building or other structure shall penetrate the alternate sky exposure plane set forth in the table in this Section. The sky exposure plane shall be measured from a point above the street line."},{"id":"zr-17411-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In an M1-6 District, if the open area provided under the terms of this Section is a <strong><em>public plaza</em></strong>, such open area may be counted toward the bonus provided for a <strong><em>public plaza</em></strong>, pursuant to Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-14\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iv/chapter-3#43-14\"><span>43-14</span></a> (Floor Area Bonus for Public Plazas and Arcades).</span></p>","plainText":"In an M1-6 District, if the open area provided under the terms of this Section is a public plaza, such open area may be counted toward the bonus provided for a public plaza, pursuant to Section 43-14 (Floor Area Bonus for Public Plazas and Arcades)."},{"id":"zr-17411-block-004","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In M1-1 Districts, for <strong><em>community facility buildings</em></strong> the height above the <strong><em>street line</em></strong> shall be 35 feet.</span></p>","plainText":"In M1-1 Districts, for community facility buildings the height above the street line shall be 35 feet."},{"id":"zr-17411-block-005","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span>ALTERNATE REQUIRED FRONT SETBACKS</span></p>","plainText":"ALTERNATE REQUIRED FRONT SETBACKS"},{"id":"zr-17411-block-006","kind":"html","html":"<p><a id=\"t.366f5105f53820e9fb835980753a087088754eaa\"></a><a id=\"t.3\"></a></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17411-block-007","kind":"table","html":"<table style=\"margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin-right:auto\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:22.5pt\"><td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:154.1pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>Depth of Optional Front Open Area<br>\n\t\t\t(in feet)</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 6pt 0pt 6pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:313.8pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p><span>Alternate <strong><em>Sky Exposure Plane</em></strong></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\" style=\"border